            "crux": "1. Sec 13: Mandatory audit of all expenditure from CFI/CFS.\n2. Sec 14: Substantial financing criteria (25 Lakhs & 75%, or 1 Crore).\n3. Sec 16: Audit of tax and non-tax receipts.\n4. Sec 18: Unrestricted power to call for records and inspect offices.\n5. Sec 19(1)/19(3): Statutory corporations and PSU audits.",
