            "content": "### Computer Assisted Audit Techniques (CAATs) Used in IA&AD\n\n1. **Core CAAT Tools**:\n   - **Tableau**: Visual data analytics, dashboard creation, identifying geographic clusters of anomalies, time-series expenditure trends.\n   - **Knime**: Visual workflow-based data science tool; joining massive datasets without coding; automated data cleansing and deduplication.\n   - **SQL (PostgreSQL / SQLite)**: High-speed querying, joins, aggregations, cross-table reconciliations.\n   - **IDEA / Arbutus**: Specialized financial audit software; automated Benford's Law testing, duplicate extraction, gap analysis, monetary unit sampling.\n   - **Python (Pandas / NumPy)**: Advanced script-based data wrangling, web scraping of public tender data, and machine learning models.",
