            "content": "### Book of Forms Referred in CPWA Code: Critical Works Forms\n\n1. **Form 21**: Muster Roll (Daily attendance of muster roll labour, record of work done, acquittance).\n2. **Form 23**: Measurement Book (MB) - official record of all works executed and supplies received.\n3. **Form 24**: First and Final Bill (Used for payments to contractors when work is completed in a single billing).\n4. **Form 26**: Running Account Bill - Form A (Used when advance payments or secured advances are made to contractors).\n5. **Form 27**: Running Account Bill - Form B (Used for standard intermediate bills based on detailed measurements).\n6. **Form 51**: Schedule of Monthly Settlement with Treasuries (Reconciles cheques issued and remittances made with treasury passbook).\n7. **Form 64**: Schedule of Works Expenditure (Monthly expenditure booked against sanctioned estimates of each work).\n8. **Form 80**: Monthly Account of Divisional Officer submitted to Accountant General.",
            "gist": "Key CPWA Forms: Form 21 (Muster Roll), Form 23 (MB), Form 24 (First & Final Bill), Form 26/27 (Running Account Bills), Form 51 (Treasury settlement), and Form 80 (Monthly Division Account).",
