        "syllabusText": "1. Nature and Scope, Basic concepts and Conventions, GAAP. 2. Accounting Process: Journal, Ledger, BRS, Trial Balance, Rectification of Errors. 3. Depreciation, Provisions and Reserves. 4. Final Accounts: Sole Proprietorship & Non-Profit (Fund Accounting). 5. Company Accounts: Share Capital, Borrowings, Final Accounts. 6. Analysis of Financial Statements: Ratios, Common-Size, Comparative, Cash Flow.",
