            "title": "(iv) General Checks while compiling Accounts & checks by I.T.A.",
            "content": "### Internal Test Audit (ITA) Checks on Government Accounts\n\n1. **General Compilation Checks**: Verifying arithmetic accuracy, voucher reconciliation, correctness of 15-digit classification codes, and absence of minus balances under revenue expenditure.\n2. **ITA Scrutiny**:\n   - Independent internal quality assurance wing inside AG (A&E) office.\n   - Test checks monthly classified abstracts, treasury schedules, GPF broadsheets, and pension cases.\n   - Issues Internal Test Audit Reports (ITAR) on persistent accounting lapses.",
