            "content": "### Maintenance of Provident and Other Funds: MSO (A&E) Vol I Chapter 12\n\n1. **Subscriber Ledger & Broadsheet**:\n   - Posting monthly deductions from treasury schedules into individual subscriber ledgers.\n   - Monthly balancing of ledger totals with the compilation broadsheet and General Ledger (Major Head 8009).\n2. **Interest Calculation**:\n   - Interest calculated at government-notified rate on monthly minimum balances between 5th and last day of month.\n   - Credited on 31st March of each financial year.\n3. **Missing Credits and Unposted Items**:\n   - Reconciliation of unposted items where subscriber details are missing; tracked in Register of Unposted Credits.\n4. **Annual GPF Statements**: Generated electronically and issued to subscribers showing opening balance, subscriptions, advances, interest, and closing balance.\n5. **Final Payment on Retirement**: Sanction issued by AG upon receipt of final withdrawal application; interest allowed for up to 6 months beyond retirement date.",
