            "content": "### Internal Control Systems in Treasury Operations\n\n1. **Dual-Lock Strong Room Custody**: Strong room keys divided between Treasury Officer and Treasurer; neither can open safe alone.\n2. **Daily Cash Balance Verification**: Physical verification of currency notes and coins at close of business daily; agreement with Cash Book.\n3. **Monthly Verification of Stamps**: Physical stock verification of judicial and non-judicial stamps on the last working day of every month.\n4. **Segregation of Duties**: Complete separation of duties between token clerk, bill verification clerk, and sanctioning officer.\n5. **DDO Signature Verification**: Mandatory cross-checking of DDO signature on every bill against specimen signature register before payment.",
